---
---

<section class="pipeline section" id="pipeline">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="pipeline-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">
        A complete end-to-end<br />
        <span class="accent-text">identity pipeline.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        GitSetu isn't just a directory switcher. It's a zero-trust orchestrator that automates the entire lifecycle of your Git authentication.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pipeline-grid">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="pipeline-step">
        <div class="step-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 2l-2 2m-7.61 7.61a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-7.778 7.778 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 7.777-7.777zm0 0L15.5 7.5m0 0l3 3L22 7l-3-3m-3.5 3.5L19 4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3 class="step-title">Key Generation & Hardware Auth</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">Automatically generates modern <code>ed25519</code> SSH keys. Need ultimate security? It natively bootstraps FIDO2/YubiKey hardware tokens (<code>ed25519-sk</code>) out of the box.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="pipeline-step">
        <div class="step-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3 class="step-title">Config & Credential Brokering</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">Intelligently wires up your <code>~/.ssh/config</code> and injects <code>includeIf</code> blocks into your global Git config. Idempotent and guaranteed to never corrupt your existing setups.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="pipeline-step">
        <div class="step-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3 class="step-title">Automated Commit Signing</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">Automatically configures SSH Commit Signing (<code>gpg.format = ssh</code>). Get the coveted green "Verified" badge on GitHub immediately, without ever touching the GPG nightmare.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="pipeline-step">
        <div class="step-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3 class="step-title">Zero-Trust Identity Guard</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">A highly secure pre-commit hook acts as a final firewall. If you ever try to commit from a terminal session using the wrong email, it fails securely. You can never slip up.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pipeline {
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .pipeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 100vw;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--border-subtle), transparent);
  }

  .pipeline-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4xl);
  }

  .pipeline-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .pipeline-step {
    background: var(--gradient-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-2xl);
    position: relative;
    transition: transform var(--transition-base), box-shadow var(--transition-base), border-color var(--transition-base);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .pipeline-step:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
    border-color: var(--accent-primary);
  }

  .step-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.1);
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.2);
  }

  .step-title {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .step-desc {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .step-desc code {
    background: var(--bg-tertiary);
    color: var(--accent-secondary);
    padding: 0.1em 0.3em;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .pipeline-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
